# =============================================================================
# SuperCool Finances — root .gitignore
# NEVER commit real secrets. Only `.env.example` is committed (see negation).
# =============================================================================

# --- Environment / secrets --------------------------------------------------
# Ignore every env file (.env, .env.local, .env.production, ...) ...
.env*
# ...but keep the committed template:
!.env.example

# --- Node / build outputs (arrive with services + frontends, steps 3-5) -----
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Logs / debug -----------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
